# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Go sources are always checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says:
# gofmt (and golangci-lint's gofmt/goimports formatters) reject CRLF, so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true flagged every file of the project.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
